align:middle;margin-left:2px}.rich-text .margin-cms{margin-left:4px}.rich-text p:empty{display:none}.rich-text .currency{border-bottom:1px dotted #999;cursor:pointer;color:#2f434d}.rich-text #currency-tip{position:absolute;top:0;left:0;width:180px;padding:15px 20px;font-size:13px;line-height:18px;border-radius:4px;box-shadow:0 3px 6px #0006;z-index:55557!important;background-color:#fff}.rich-text .actions{margin-top:32px!important;margin-bottom:32px!important}.rich-text a.button{text-decoration:none!important}\\u0040media (min-width: 768px){.rich-text img{display:inline-block!important;padding:0;vertical-align:middle;max-width:276px}.rich-text img.small{max-width:254px!important}.rich-text img.medium{max-width:378px!important}.rich-text img.large{max-width:480px!important}.rich-text img.full{max-width:100\\u0025!important}.rich-text img.center{display:block!important;margin:0 auto}.rich-text img.half{max-width:354px;max-height:none!important;margin-left:12px;float:left}.rich-text img.third{max-width:250px!important;margin-left:12px;float:left}.rich-text img.third:first-child,.rich-text img.half:first-child{margin-left:0}.rich-text img.half:last-of-type,.rich-text img.third:last-of-type{float:none}.rich-text img.half:last-of-type:after,.rich-text img.third:last-of-type:after{content:\\\".\\\";display:block;height:0;clear:both;visibility:hidden}}\\u0040media (max-width: 767px){.rich-text img{max-width:100\\u0025}}.rich-text-section+.rich-text-section{margin-top:75px}.rich-text-section_title h1,.rich-text-section_title h2,.rich-text-section_title h3,.rich-text-section_title h4,.rich-text-section_title h5,.rich-text-section_title h6{margin-bottom:.8em!important}\\nimg{max-width:280px}.small{max-width:240px}.medium{max-width:320px}.large{max-width:360px}\\u003C/style>\\u003C/head>\\u003Cbody dir=\\\"ltr\\\" class=\\\"_8isn _agix x1 Locale_en_US\\\">\\u003Cdiv class=\\\"_8isn\\\">\\u003Cdiv class=\\\"_8iso\\\">\\u003Cdiv class=\\\"_8iu9\\\">\\u003Cdiv class=\\\"rich-text\\\">\\u003Ch1>About safely communicating with WhatsApp Support\\u003C/h1>\\u003Cblockquote>\\u003Cp>We&rsquo;re building and testing out new features, like WhatsApp Support with AI (artificial intelligence), and they may not be available to you yet. In the meantime, we recommend keeping WhatsApp updated on your device, so you can get the feature as soon as it&rsquo;s available.\\u003C/p>\\u003C/blockquote>\\u003Cp>When you contact us with a question, WhatsApp Support may communicate with you in a chat thread or over email. Responses from WhatsApp Support may be generated by artificial intelligence (AI). At times, messages generated by AI may be inaccurate or inappropriate. We recommend checking the Help Center to further assist in resolving your issue.\\u003C/p>\\u003Cp>WhatsApp will never ask you for sensitive personal information, your full name, PIN, or payment details.\\u003C/p>\\u003Ch3>WhatsApp support via in-app chat\\u003C/h3>\\u003Cp>When you connect with WhatsApp Support in a chat thread, we'll only message you from our official WhatsApp Support account, which is marked with the verified badge and the \\u003Cb>Official Support Account\\u003C/b> label.\\u003C/p>\\u003Cp>You might also interact with artificial intelligence (AI), when you contact WhatsApp Support. Responses generated by AI are labeled with \\u003Cb>AI\\u003C/b>\\u003Cimg class=\\\"img\\\" src=\\\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/assets/?set=whatsapp_help_article_assets&amp;name=platform-agnostic-ai-sparkle&amp;density=1\\\" width=\\\"25\\\" height=\\\"25\\\" alt=\\\"AI Sparkle (sparkle dust)\\\"> in the message bubble.\\u003C/p>\\u003Cp>\\u003Cb>Note\\u003C/b>: If you receive a message claiming to be WhatsApp Support, but doesn&rsquo;t have the verified badge or the \\u003Cb>Official Support Account\\u003C/b> label, this is likely a scam. Please do not reply and promptly report and/or block this number.\\u003C/p>\\u003Ch3>WhatsApp support via our website contact form\\u003C/h3>\\u003Cp>When you connect with WhatsApp Support over email, we'll get back to you with an email response. WhatsApp Support will only contact you from email addresses ending in \\u003Cb>\\u0040support.whatsapp.com\\u003C/b>.\\u003C/p>\\u003Cp>When contacting support via opur website contact form, you can also provide additional information, which will appear in the contents and attachments of your submission to WhatsApp support.\\u003C/p>\\u003Ch3>Provide feedback in-app\\u003C/h3>\\u003Cp>You can provide feedback about AI responses from WhatsApp Support.\\u003C/p>\\u003Col>\\u003Cli>Tap and hold the response you&rsquo;d like to provide feedback on.\\u003C/li>\\u003Cli>Tap \\u003Cimg class=\\\"img\\\" src=\\\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/assets/?set=whatsapp_help_article_assets&amp;name=android-thumbs-up&amp;density=1\\\" width=\\\"25\\\" height=\\\"25\\\" alt=\\\"Thumbs Up (thumbs up)\\\"> or \\u003Cimg class=\\\"img\\\" src=\\\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/assets/?set=whatsapp_help_article_assets&amp;name=android-thumbs-down&amp;density=1\\\" width=\\\"25\\\" height=\\\"25\\\" alt=\\\"Thumbs Down (thumbs down)\\\">.\\u003C/li>\\u003Cli>If prompted, add a reason, then tap \\u003Cb>Submit\\u003C/b>.\\u003C/li>\\u003C/ol>\\u003Ch3>Information WhatsApp collects when you contact support\\u003C/h3>\\u003Cp>When you contact WhatsApp Support, in addition to the information you provide directly describing your issue, WhatsApp collects your phone number or email address (depending on how you contact WhatsApp Support) to contact you to resolve your issue.\\u003C/p>\\u003Cp>When contacting WhatsApp Support from within the app, WhatsApp collects your phone number and may collect additional information that's necessary to understand and resolve your issue, which includes:\\u003C/p>\\u003Cul>\\u003Cli>Phone network information, such as carrier and network type\\u003C/li>\\u003Cli>Device information, such as device type and free space available\\u003C/li>\\u003Cli>Device settings, such as language and permissions granted to WhatsApp\\u003C/li>\\u003Cli>Backup settings, such as backup frequency and time of last backup\\u003C/li>\\u003Cli>WhatsApp app information, such as version number\\u003C/li>\\u003Cli>Logging information about how features were used, which helps us understand what might have gone wrong\\u003C/li>\\u003C/ul>\\u003Ch3>Related resources\\u003C/h3>\\u003Cul>\\u003Cli>How to \\u003Ca href=\\\"https://faq.whatsapp.com/1336994774516288/\\\" data-lnfb-mode=\\\"ie\\\">contact WhatsApp Support\\u003C/a>\\u003C/li>\\u003Cli>About \\u003Ca href=\\\"https://faq.whatsapp.com/1083092416402722/\\\" data-lnfb-mode=\\\"ie\\\">WhatsApp Support with artificial intelligence (AI)\\u003C/a>\\u003C/li>\\u003C/ul>\\u003C/div>\\u003Cdiv class=\\\"_a0jc\\\">\\u003Cdiv class=\\\"_aini\\\">Does this answer your question?\\u003C/div>\\u003Cdiv class=\\\"_ainj\\\">\\u003Ca class=\\\"_aink\\\" href=\\\"https://faq.whatsapp.com/client_search_feedback/?enc=AfaWF260QKvsneuuLzKQt-P-nGGd9Nz6Eo9KQnnHEZ0t0yLLlZkrNAmGBCakN1015_UPBVXG3SU5dlAn749A6wl--hrXxkSY6bAyWlmx3LngBt86xMBdSLk-LHo3kLtvQxObVa0gcNV3NNtgqMy7Vct1lwE7Oj0DatUacg1vNsML0Q\\\" data-lnfb-mode=\\\"ie\\\">Yes\\u003C/a>\\u003Ca class=\\\"_aink\\\" href=\\\"https://faq.whatsapp.com/client_search_feedback/?enc=AfZv1ROE8H0Il4wDVYVeuLyEDiINv4w0vNeThNCqVzXSDjfrO4YlU2yEB8m001pBCkIy3AWD-rv2igZ4fwB42qBHi11vIQ-8zm11pYLsyrGd3GU9ExbLQYCr7p-Kx6nuJ2D_xxWcFgQh9Q5odhmFACT0et3xCTg4jhTGE_K4aiXQ\\\" data-lnfb-mode=\\\"ie\\\">No\\u003C/a>\\u003C/div>\\u003Cimg src=\\\"https://faq.whatsapp.com/client_search_feedback_pixel.png?enc=AfYNK0C3QAXXMPUjs1XLrnlfujUZKdxFihTT2fX6IxzYduZvduuUM1kZ5r3ns2I53iqKr2naudKrp0kTNxgK153bYYJN0TC1exL-37UT3IkB5mZGnt3cZpkbQivJwy4ZVDWnLc-gBaLhugJjzpp3FCL7dUkEuSSFJhwK6gVcqay1\\\" alt=\\\"\\\">\\u003C/div>\\u003C/div>\\u003C/div>\\u003C/div>\\u003C/body>\\u003C/html>\\n\"},{\"title\":\"About view once\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"url\":\"https://faq.whatsapp.com/1077018839582332/?cms_id=/1077018839582332\",\"id\":\"1077018839582332